        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Request health \u2192 Dependencies \u2192 Workers \u2192 Kubernetes \u2192 Logs**\n\nRates describe long-running processes. Worker snapshots describe **one completed invocation**. Missing data stays unknown; an available metrics endpoint does not prove database readiness. The service-instance filter does not filter worker collectors."
